<http://data.silknow.org/object/a0fcb203-37ed-3e13-bf50-70fca686eb21>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The Magi, Joseph, and a donor stand on flower-covered meadow (millefleurs).  The left part of tapestry on which Madonna and Child originally appeared has been cut off.  The donor stands beside a white horse at right end with an unidentified armorial shield over his left shoulder.  The shepherds, the angel of the Lord, and a walled city appear in background.  Woven with polychrome silk and wool yarns and metallic threads.  Seven warp threads to cm."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0fdad8e2-b7aa-3b81-8e10-2887fdde9fe3> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "The Magi, Joseph, and a donor stand on flower-covered meadow (millefleurs).  The left part of tapestry on which Madonna and Child originally appeared has been cut off.  The donor stands beside a white horse at right end with an unidentified armorial shield over his left shoulder.  The shepherds, the angel of the Lord, and a walled city appear in background.  Woven with polychrome silk and wool yarns and metallic threads.  Seven warp threads to cm."@en ;
